{"base_rate":0.43486590038314177,"brier":0.11611379310344828,"bss":0.5275270544314193,"bss_hi":0.6247469822193047,"bss_lo":0.407176731823791,"chart":{"base":[437.9,100.0],"fp":[287.0,284.6],"note":{"base":"skill 0.53 — higher than 94% of cities","fp":"low end +4pp, high end +7pp","rel":"promised 1% → rained 4%; promised 99% → rained 90%"},"rel":"66.4,447.3 281.3,299.8 584.6,123.8 688.8,77.6"},"country":"NP","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve"],"ece":0.05482758620689656,"ess":126.58108837711576,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Pokhara</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Pokhara rain forecast is strongly skilful, though 3 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>90%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(1%), there is still roughly a <b>4%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 522 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-02-01. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 7.5 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.53, ranked 12 of\n216 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(4&ndash;54) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'><b>4%</b></td><td class='num'>208</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>21%</td><td class='num'><b>28%</b></td><td class='num'>53</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>49%</td><td class='num'><b>49%</b></td><td class='num'>51</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>74%</td><td class='num'><b>77%</b></td><td class='num'>52</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>92%</td><td class='num'><b>82%</b></td><td class='num'>49</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>90%</b></td><td class='num'>109</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">3 of 6 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Pokhara</b> <span class=\"muted\">Nepal</span></p>\n  <div class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag good\">Strongly skilful</span><details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What does this label mean?\" title=\"What does this label mean?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>Compared with a simple guess: saying &ldquo;43% chance of rain&rdquo; every day, because it rains here on 43% of days.</p><p>The forecast did far better.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details>\n    <span class=\"muted\">3 points off by more than chance</span></div>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score<details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What is the skill score?\" title=\"What is the skill score?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>How much better the forecast is than that simple guess. 0 means no better, 1 means perfect, below 0 means worse. Day-ahead rain forecasts usually score 0.3 to 0.5.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details></dt><dd>0.53</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>4&ndash;54\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 216</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>522 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Pokhara &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Pokhara\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"60.48480769230769,375.0 131.33811320754717,265.24528301886795 233.0564705882353,153.60784313725492 321.3896153846154,67.0 383.7522448979592,25.428571428571445 410.18128440366974,18.0 410.18128440366974,24.67889908256882 383.7522448979592,77.42857142857139 321.3896153846154,158.0 233.0564705882353,253.52941176470588 131.33811320754717,340.79245283018867 60.48480769230769,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"223.7088122605364\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"223.7088122605364\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"60.48480769230769,366.25 131.33811320754717,278.9811320754717 233.0564705882353,203.5686274509804 321.3896153846154,102.0 383.7522448979592,84.85714285714283 410.18128440366974,54.73394495412845\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 4% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 208 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"60.48480769230769\" cy=\"366.25\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 21%&amp;#10;It rained 28% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 53 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"131.33811320754717\" cy=\"278.9811320754717\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 49%&amp;#10;It rained 49% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 51 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"233.0564705882353\" cy=\"203.5686274509804\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 74%&amp;#10;It rained 77% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 52 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"321.3896153846154\" cy=\"102.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 92%&amp;#10;It rained 82% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 49 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"383.7522448979592\" cy=\"84.85714285714283\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 90% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 109 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"410.18128440366974\" cy=\"54.73394495412845\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(43%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Not enough days in this city's record to split the year into four and still say anything defensible about each part. The split is shown only where it is supported.</p>\n"},"lat":28.26689,"lon":83.96851,"n":522,"n_cities":216,"name":"Pokhara","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.1,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.00701923076923077,"n":208,"obs":0.04326923076923077,"sig":true},{"hi":0.33999999999999997,"lo":0.1,"mean":0.20716981132075468,"n":53,"obs":0.2830188679245283,"sig":false},{"hi":0.65,"lo":0.33999999999999997,"mean":0.4945098039215686,"n":51,"obs":0.49019607843137253,"sig":false},{"hi":0.86,"lo":0.65,"mean":0.7440384615384615,"n":52,"obs":0.7692307692307693,"sig":false},{"hi":0.96,"lo":0.86,"mean":0.9202040816326531